# Generated artifacts
# `reports/*` (not `reports/`) so git still descends into the directory and the
# research-audit documents below can be re-included. Excluding the directory
# itself would make negation impossible ("It is not possible to re-include a file
# if a parent directory of that file is excluded"). Everything not re-included
# here — evaluation curves, confusion matrices, exported zips — stays ignored.
reports/*
!reports/*.md
!reports/*.json
!reports/*.csv
!reports/data_validation/
reports/data_validation/*
!reports/data_validation/DATA_VALIDATION_REPORT.md
!reports/data_validation/LEAKAGE_ANALYSIS.md
data/clinical/synthetic/
data/oai/raw/
data/oai/processed/
data/oai/reports/
/models
